OL,3,GNEWSANew #30m leisure centre plan is
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe designs for a new #30m leisure
OL,7,Fcentre in Nottinghamshire have been
OL,8,Fgiven the go-ahead.
OL,10,FGedling Borough Council's planning
OL,11,Fcommittee voted through plans for the
OL,12,FCarlton Active facility to be built on
OL,13,Fthe site of the Richard Herrod Centre
OL,14,Foff Foxhill Road.
OL,16,FThe old building closed in April 2026
OL,17,Fand is currently being demolished as
OL,18,Fpart of a wider revamp project that
OL,19,Falso seeks to tear down the Carlton
OL,20,FForum site.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
