OL,3,GNEWSANew #30m leisure centre plan is
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FCarlton Active, which will have a
OL,7,Fsmaller footprint than the current
OL,8,Fcentre, will include an eight-lane
OL,9,Fswimming pool, a teaching pool, cafe,
OL,10,Fsoft play area, community room, and a
OL,11,Fstudio with power-assisted equipment.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
